        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laba balihlazo emadilini enu othando nxa besidla lani bengesabi, bezinanzelela bona bodwa. Bangamayezi angelamanzi, aphetshulwa ngumoya; bayizihlahla ezingatheliyo zebusika, ezife kabili, sezisitshulwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bangamavinqo olwandle aphosekayo, abhubhudla amahlazo awo; bazinkanyezi eziduhayo ezigcinelwe umnyama omkhulu ongapheliyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JUD 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UEnoki ongowesizukulwana sesikhombisa kusukela kuAdamu waprofetha ngabo, wathi: Khangelani, iNkosi yafika kanye labangcwele bayo abayizigidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JUD.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JUD.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.5.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 5:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
