          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuye uNkulunkulu oyedwa uMsilisi wethu, ngoJesu Kristu iNkosi yethu, kakube inkazimulo, lobukhulu, lobukhosi, lamandla, kungakabi khona isikhathi, lakhathesi, kuze kube nini lanini. Ameni.",
          "type": "text",
